{"timestamp": 1779334381.658863, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 17, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "weapons", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779334381.659947, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 17, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779334386.924106, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I reported Diana\u2019s body in Weapons. I had just come in from Security and found her there.\n\nMy route this round was Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons. I saw Eve in Upper Engine around ticks 2-4, and Bob in Electrical around ticks 8-9. I also saw Bob leave Electrical toward Medbay at tick 10. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near Weapons before I found Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334396.9797618, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I started lower engine, went up to upper engine, then oxygen, cafeteria, and ended in medbay when the report happened. I did not see Diana at all this round, and I never went near Weapons.\n\nOnly person I saw was Eve: she entered upper engine from oxygen around tick 8, and I saw her in upper engine ticks 8-9. So Eve was definitely on the left side then. I didn\u2019t see Charlie or Bob myself, and I didn\u2019t see anyone heading toward Weapons.  \n\nCharlie\u2019s report puts Bob leaving Electrical toward Medbay at tick 10, which is interesting since Weapons is on the right side near Security/Cafeteria, but I can\u2019t confirm that. No hard accuse from me yet \u2014 just sharing that Eve was left side with me mid-round."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334418.639135, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I was in Storage at the end with Eve, so she can confirm I wasn\u2019t near Weapons when the report happened. My route was mostly mid/bottom: I started around Electrical/Medbay, went through Cafeteria side earlier, then down toward Security/Navigation/Storage and Lower Engine area.\n\nI did pass near Weapons earlier and I saw Diana alive there pretty early, around tick 5-ish. I didn\u2019t see the kill or a body then, so it must\u2019ve happened after I left. After that I was nowhere near Weapons.\n\nEve was definitely around Storage/Lower Engine late \u2014 I saw her moving between Lower Engine and Storage, then toward Medbay. That matches Frank saying Eve was left side mid-round, so I\u2019m leaning Eve is probably not the kill here.\n\nThe interesting info to me is Charlie being the one coming from Security into Weapons, and Bob being in Electrical around 8-10. I\u2019m not hard accusing, but the kill likely happened on the right side after tick 5, so I\u2019d focus on who was around Security/Electrical/Weapons after that."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334505.6807091, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started Weapons, then went Security, Electrical, Medbay, and ended Upper Engine. I saw Diana alive in Security at ticks 2-3, and I specifically saw her leave Security toward Weapons at tick 4. So that lines up with Alice seeing her alive in Weapons around tick 5.\n\nIn Electrical, Charlie came in from Medbay around tick 7, and I saw him there ticks 8-10. I did leave toward Medbay after that, yes, then went Upper Engine. I never went back to Security or Weapons after early round.\n\nGiven Diana went into Weapons at tick 4 and died there, the kill had to be after that. Eve sounds pretty left-side confirmed by Frank and Alice, and Frank says he never went near Weapons. From my POV the people with the most relevant pathing are Charlie, because he went Electrical \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons and reported, and Alice because she admits being near Weapons earlier, though she says Diana was alive when she left. I don\u2019t have a hard accuse, but Charlie had the direct late path into the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334601.608236, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 back through Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine \u2192 Storage. I never went right side and I never saw Diana.\n\nI can confirm Charlie was in Upper Engine early, ticks 2-4, coming from Oxygen, so that part of his route is true. I also saw Frank around Upper Engine/Oxygen area around tick 9, so Frank being left side checks out. Late round I saw Alice enter Lower Engine from Storage at tick 14, then she and I ended together in Storage at tick 16/report, so Alice was definitely not in Weapons at the very end.\n\nFor the kill: Diana seems alive in Weapons around tick 5 from Alice, and Bob says she went there from Security at tick 4. Bob was seen in Electrical by both Charlie and Bob\u2019s own story around ticks 8-10, then left toward Medbay. The only person with a confirmed late path Electrical \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons is Charlie, and he\u2019s also the reporter. That could be normal, but it is the most direct opportunity.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Charlie here more than Bob or Alice, but I\u2019ll listen if people think the timing clears him."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334621.798622, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I get why my path looks bad because I was the one who went Security \u2192 Weapons and reported, but from my POV the body was already there when I entered Weapons. I did not see Diana alive at all this round.\n\nMy confirmed info is: Eve saw me early in Upper Engine, Bob and I were together in Electrical around ticks 8-9, and Bob left Electrical toward Medbay at tick 10. After that I went through Security into Weapons and found Diana dead.\n\nThe timing matters: Diana was in Weapons from around tick 5. That means someone could\u2019ve killed earlier and left before I arrived. Alice admits she was near Weapons earlier and then ended Storage, which is reachable if the kill happened mid-round. Bob also started Weapons/Security and was the last person saying he saw Diana path into Weapons.\n\nI\u2019m not saying it\u2019s definitely one of them, but I don\u2019t think \u201cCharlie reported on the late path\u201d is enough. I\u2019d look hardest at Alice or Bob based on who was actually near Diana before she died."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334649.724449, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info: I was left side into Cafeteria/Medbay, never went right side, and I only saw Eve in Upper Engine around ticks 8-9 entering from Oxygen. So Eve is very likely left-side and not this kill.\n\nBased on everyone\u2019s stories, Diana was alive going into Weapons around tick 4-5. Bob and Charlie both place each other in Electrical around ticks 8-10, so Bob leaving toward Medbay makes it harder for Bob to be the late killer unless the kill was very early. Alice being near Weapons around tick 5 is possible, but she also says Diana was alive then and Eve confirms Alice was in Storage late.\n\nThe cleanest opportunity is still Charlie going Electrical \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons and reporting. That could be innocent reporting, but if we\u2019re choosing based on pathing, Charlie had the most direct late access to the body. I\u2019m leaning Charlie unless someone has a stronger timing reason that clears him."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334670.6473742, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I get Charlie trying to throw it back on me, but my timing is exactly why I don\u2019t think it\u2019s me: I saw Diana alive in Weapons around tick 5, then I left and kept moving away through Security/Navigation toward Storage and Lower Engine. I never went back to Weapons after that.\n\nEve can place me late left/bottom side, and she was with me around Storage at the end. So unless the kill happened literally right after tick 5 and I somehow vanished across the map, the later pathing matters more.\n\nBob and Charlie being together in Electrical around 8-10 is important. Bob says he left toward Medbay, and Charlie says he went Security \u2192 Weapons and found the body. That is the cleanest direct route to Diana\u2019s body after the time she was confirmed alive.\n\nI\u2019m not saying reporters are always killers, but in this case Charlie\u2019s late route is the strongest opportunity we have. I\u2019m leaning Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334688.458677, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll be clear from my side: I saw Diana alive in Security ticks 2-3, then I watched her leave Security into Weapons at tick 4. After that I went Security \u2192 Electrical, and I never returned to Weapons or Security.\n\nCharlie entered Electrical from Medbay at tick 7, and I saw him with me in Electrical ticks 8-10. Then I left toward Medbay and ended Upper Engine. So from my POV, Charlie is the one who had the late route out of Electrical toward Security and then into Weapons, where the body was.\n\nAlice could technically be an earlier possibility, but multiple people place her away late, and she says Diana was alive when she saw her. Eve and Frank seem left-side confirmed. I don\u2019t think there\u2019s a hard 100% proof, but the strongest opportunity and pathing is Charlie. I\u2019m leaning vote Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1779334709.847656, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 17, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My info is the same and it mostly clears the left side for this kill: I went Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine \u2192 Storage. I never went right side at all and never saw Diana.\n\nI saw Charlie in Upper Engine early, ticks 2-4, so his early route checks out. I saw Alice late: she came into Lower Engine from Storage around tick 14, and then we ended together in Storage at the report. So Alice was definitely not in Weapons at the very end. Frank also sounds left-side from what I saw and what he said.\n\nThe key timing is Diana was alive going into Weapons around tick 4-5, then Bob and Charlie are both in Electrical around 8-10, and after that Bob leaves toward Medbay while Charlie goes Security \u2192 Weapons and reports. That is the most direct late opportunity by far.\n\nIt\u2019s not 100% proof, but with everyone\u2019s pathing, Charlie is the strongest vote. I\u2019m voting Charlie."}}
